{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 2, "text": "不与吾师主人相干，各宜远避。", "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 245, "w": 543, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不与吾师主人相干，各宜远避。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 426, "y": 245, "w": 543, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 3, "text": "姜太公在此，诸邪回避，大吉大利！”", "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 302, "w": 615, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "姜太公在此，诸邪回避，大吉大利！”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 430, "y": 302, "w": 615, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 4, "text": "布依族相信口彩，即“吉言”，相信建造过程中每个仪式上由石、木二匠或宾朋口中说", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 360, "w": 1472, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族相信口彩，即“吉言”，相信建造过程中每个仪式上由石、木二匠或宾朋口中说", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 360, "w": 1472, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 5, "text": "出的吉言都能给建房主人带来好运。如上梁仪式上，石、木二匠师傅先设神台祭供鲁班，", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 430, "w": 1552, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "出的吉言都能给建房主人带来好运。如上梁仪式上，石、木二匠师傅先设神台祭供鲁班，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 430, "w": 1552, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 6, "text": "同时祭供家神。然后木匠把主人舅家送来的大梁修整好。修整时，木匠手提凿子、握着", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 495, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "同时祭供家神。然后木匠把主人舅家送来的大梁修整好。修整时，木匠手提凿子、握着", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 495, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 7, "text": "利斧开梁头。主人身穿新装，恭恭敬敬地双膝跪下。木匠唱：", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 559, "w": 1069, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "利斧开梁头。主人身穿新装，恭恭敬敬地双膝跪下。木匠唱：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 559, "w": 1069, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 8, "text": "“一开梁头，子孙代代中诸侯；", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 628, "w": 523, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“一开梁头，子孙代代中诸侯；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 628, "w": 523, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 9, "text": "千年发户，万年生辉。主人家要富吗要贵？”", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 688, "w": 761, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "千年发户，万年生辉。主人家要富吗要贵？”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 688, "w": 761, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 10, "text": "主人答：“富贵都要！”", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 756, "w": 374, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "主人答：“富贵都要！”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 756, "w": 374, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 11, "text": "接着木匠用斧凿开梁头，主人用衣兜接木屑。木匠又唱：", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 825, "w": 985, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "接着木匠用斧凿开梁头，主人用衣兜接木屑。木匠又唱：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 825, "w": 985, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 12, "text": "“二开梁腰，儿孙代代佩服金刀；", "bbox_px": {"x": 176, "y": 881, "w": 568, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“二开梁腰，儿孙代代佩服金刀；", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 176, "y": 881, "w": 568, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 13, "text": "三开梁尾，儿孙代代仕位高。主人家要文吗要武？”", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 945, "w": 884, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "三开梁尾，儿孙代代仕位高。主人家要文吗要武？”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 945, "w": 884, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 14, "text": "主人答：“文武都要！”又接木屑。", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1014, "w": 563, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "主人答：“文武都要！”又接木屑。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1014, "w": 563, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 15, "text": "随即，由木匠量尺寸画墨线、截长短、锯好棒，用红布包好搁着盐、茶、米、豆、笔墨和", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1082, "w": 1459, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "随即，由木匠量尺寸画墨线、截长短、锯好棒，用红布包好搁着盐、茶、米、豆、笔墨和", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1082, "w": 1459, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 16, "text": "一个银元的梁包，以示主家将来五谷丰登、人才辈出；再次祭祀鲁班，再放鞭炮，由舅家寨", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1147, "w": 1552, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一个银元的梁包，以示主家将来五谷丰登、人才辈出；再次祭祀鲁班，再放鞭炮，由舅家寨", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1147, "w": 1552, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 17, "text": "和主家寨后生一边一方，用绳拴好梁头，一同将梁拉上中柱顶上。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1211, "w": 1130, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "和主家寨后生一边一方，用绳拴好梁头，一同将梁拉上中柱顶上。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1211, "w": 1130, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 18, "text": "大梁上好，木匠师傅边爬上房架边向主家祝贺：", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1275, "w": 816, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "大梁上好，木匠师傅边爬上房架边向主家祝贺：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1275, "w": 816, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 19, "text": "“上了头穿（枋）到二穿，主家儿孙做高官。上了三穿到屋梁，主家儿孙聚满堂⋯••”", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1336, "w": 1475, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“上了头穿（枋）到二穿，主家儿孙做高官。上了三穿到屋梁，主家儿孙聚满堂⋯••”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1336, "w": 1475, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 20, "text": "舅家送梁人有能说吉语者，也要爬到梁的另一头与木匠师傅对答。上梁完毕，开始撒“梁", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1404, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "舅家送梁人有能说吉语者，也要爬到梁的另一头与木匠师傅对答。上梁完毕，开始撒“梁", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1404, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 21, "text": "粑”。梁粑有杯茶口大，糯米做成，粑上点画一些植物汁的红绿颜色；梁下众亲友争抢梁", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1464, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "粑”。梁粑有杯茶口大，糯米做成，粑上点画一些植物汁的红绿颜色；梁下众亲友争抢梁", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1464, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 22, "text": "粑，抢得多者认为会得到好运。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1537, "w": 535, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "粑，抢得多者认为会得到好运。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1537, "w": 535, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 23, "text": "修整好大梁，接着包梁。先把一块银元钉于梁的中线，放上两支毛笔，两碇墨，又放", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1601, "w": 1463, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "修整好大梁，接着包梁。先把一块银元钉于梁的中线，放上两支毛笔，两碇墨，又放", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1601, "w": 1463, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 24, "text": "一个小碟子和茶叶，放一本头大尾小的历书（即农历正月大和十二月大的年历），用纸钱", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1666, "w": 1552, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一个小碟子和茶叶，放一本头大尾小的历书（即农历正月大和十二月大的年历），用纸钱", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1666, "w": 1552, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 25, "text": "包好，用一块方形红布，四角拴好五色线布，成菱形用银钉扎好，使五色线布垂吊成穗带，", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1730, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "包好，用一块方形红布，四角拴好五色线布，成菱形用银钉扎好，使五色线布垂吊成穗带，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1730, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 26, "text": "又用主人家的一段染公土布把梁缠好，名为“挂彩”。人们认为，这样也会给主人带来荣", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1786, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "又用主人家的一段染公土布把梁缠好，名为“挂彩”。人们认为，这样也会给主人带来荣", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1786, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 27, "text": "华富贵。", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1859, "w": 149, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "华富贵。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1859, "w": 149, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 28, "text": "经济条件较好的人家，在立房当天就安装大门。但一些人家却是在住进新房后才安", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1923, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "经济条件较好的人家，在立房当天就安装大门。但一些人家却是在住进新房后才安", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1923, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 29, "text": "装。大门一般都是用木板装修的，门都是长条形双开木板门，高两米多，两扇门共宽一米", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1987, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "装。大门一般都是用木板装修的，门都是长条形双开木板门，高两米多，两扇门共宽一米", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 1987, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 30, "text": "多，门的两边都有通风窗子，窗子古色古香，有些还雕有各种花草或奔龙飞风，古雅美观。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 2052, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "多，门的两边都有通风窗子，窗子古色古香，有些还雕有各种花草或奔龙飞风，古雅美观。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 2052, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 31, "text": "大门全部装修好，主人还要选吉日举行开财门仪式，相信通过这个仪式，可以给主人带来", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 2116, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "大门全部装修好，主人还要选吉日举行开财门仪式，相信通过这个仪式，可以给主人带来", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 2116, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 32, "text": "财运。仪式一般由两木匠主持。二人一在门外一在门里，敲着锣鼓，吟唱“开财门歌”", "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2181, "w": 1528, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "财运。仪式一般由两木匠主持。二人一在门外一在门里，敲着锣鼓，吟唱“开财门歌”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 101, "y": 2181, "w": 1528, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 439, "line_no": 33, "text": "内容均为祝福之词。对唱完毕，将一段红布钉于门上，并用五色丝线结成穗带垂吊，门的", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 2249, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "内容均为祝福之词。对唱完毕，将一段红布钉于门上，并用五色丝线结成穗带垂吊，门的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 2249, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
